; The exports of kernel32.dll (ReactOS 0.4.16, i386) that the Win32 test
; programs call, for their import library (`cargo xtask` builds it with
; dlltool --kill-at). stdcall functions carry their argument bytes (@N); the
; DLL exports them undecorated.
LIBRARY kernel32.dll
EXPORTS
CloseHandle@4
CreateFileW@28
CreateProcessW@40
CreateThread@24
DeleteCriticalSection@4
EnterCriticalSection@4
ExitProcess@4
FindClose@4
FindFirstFileW@8
FindNextFileW@8
GetConsoleMode@8
GetConsoleWindow@0
GetCurrentProcessId@0
GetCurrentThreadId@0
GetExitCodeProcess@8
GetLastError@0
GetModuleHandleW@4
GetStdHandle@4
InitializeCriticalSection@4
LoadLibraryW@4
LeaveCriticalSection@4
ReadConsoleW@20
ReadFile@20
SetLastError@4
Sleep@4
VirtualQuery@12
WaitForMultipleObjects@16
WaitForSingleObject@8
WriteConsoleW@20
